 \; meet-ups in Barcelona (late Nov/early Dec 2026) and Berlin (May 2027). 
 Open to legal residents of EU member states\, Horizon Europe associated co
 untries\, and the pilot countries Ghana\, South Africa\, Indonesia\, Phili
 ppines and Chile.
END:VEVENT
